Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,what the ****?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:01.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,could the bulls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:03.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,beat five snowmen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:03.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,the bulls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:05.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,are nba players.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:06.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,the snowmen can't jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:08.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,they're literally melting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:08.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,this should be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:09.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,the easiest win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:10.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,of the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:11.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,except, the bulls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:12.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,are 1-7, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:14.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,they've lost 6 straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:15.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,tip-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:16.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,nobody jumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:16.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,the snowmen get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:18.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,the ball anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:18.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,norman powell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:19.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,misses a three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.44,0:00:20.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,then caleb wilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:21.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,then the bulls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:23.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,miss 34 threes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:23.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,in the first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:24.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,quarter, one snowman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:26.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,scores 22 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:27.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,the entire bulls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:29.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,team scores 21.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:30.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,at halftime, it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.14,0:00:31.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,84 to 52.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:32.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,snowmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:32.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,by the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:33.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,fourth quarter, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:35.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,snowmen are half-melted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:35.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,they still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:36.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,win by 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:38.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,final score: snowmen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:41.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,135, bulls 105.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:42.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,the bulls are now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:43.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,tied for the worst
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:44.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,record in the nba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:45.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,next up,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:46.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,the 8-1 sixers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:47.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,the snowmen offered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:48.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,to play instead.
